Carries every FR-002 element: the `@<notifyHandle>` arm (handle `manjula25` is
configured in the fixtures profile — the present arm, not the D6 absent arm),
the outcome class `fix-failed`, the reason byte-identical to the summary, and
the console-output pointer of interpretation note 3 (no invented log artifact).
Posted exactly once; no retry. The comment author is `manjula25` (the gh
identity the harness runs as).

